xt":"In FY2025 the company paid $2.3 billion to repurchase its own shares. No dividend payment is tagged for the year.","cites":["FTNT.buybacks.2025"]},{"topic":"quarter","text":"In the three months ended 2026-09-30 revenue was $2.1 billion, up 20.5% from $1.7 billion in the three months ended 2025-09-30.","cites":["FTNT.d.revenue.2026-07-01.2026-09-30","FTNT.d.revenue.2025-07-01.2025-09-30"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-09-30 revenue added up to $7.9 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $2.6 billion and net income to $2.3 billion.","cites":["FTNT.d.revenue.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","FTNT.d.revenue.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","FTNT.d.revenue.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","FTNT.d.revenue.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","FTNT.d.revenue.2026-07-01.2026-09-30","FTNT.d.opinc.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","FTNT.d.opinc.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","FTNT.d.opinc.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","FTNT.d.opinc.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","FTNT.d.opinc.2026-07-01.2026-09-30","FTNT.d.netinc.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","FTNT.d.netinc.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","FTNT.d.netinc.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","FTNT.d.netinc.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","FTNT.d.netinc.2026-07-01.2026-09-30"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $3.4 billion: operating cash flow of $3.7 billion less capital spending of $256 million (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["FTNT.d.ocf.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","FTNT.d.ocf.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","FTNT.d.ocf.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","FTNT.d.ocf.2026-01-01.2026-06-30","FTNT.d.ocf.2026-01-01.2026-09-30","FTNT.d.capex.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","FTNT.d.capex.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","FTNT.d.capex.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","FTNT.d.capex.2026-01-01.2026-06-30","FTNT.d.capex.2026-01-01.2026-09-30"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The proxy statement filed 2026-04-29 gives the principal executive officer’s total pay for FY2025 as $11.5 million in its summary compensation table, and the “compensation actually paid” - the SEC’s measure, which revalues share awards over the year - as $1.1 million.","cites":["FTNT.pay.peoTotal.2025","FTNT.pay.peoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"For the other named executive officers the same table gives an average of $5.7 million in total and -$1.4 million actually paid.","cites":["FTNT.pay.neoTotal.2025","FTNT.pay.neoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The table puts the value of $100 held in the company’s shares over the years it covers at $267.28 at the end of FY2025, and $258.44 for the peer group the company chose.","cites":["FTNT.pay.tsr.2025","FTNT.pay.peerTsr.2025"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Remaining performance obligations - revenue under contract that was not yet recognised - were $7.2 billion at the end of FY2025, against $6.4 billion a year earlier. That is 105.6% of FY2025 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["FTNT.rpo.2025","FTNT.rpo.2024","FTNT.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $3.6 billion at the end of FY2025 (tagged DeferredRevenueCurrent), against $3.3 billion a year earlier.","cites":["FTNT.deferred.2025","FTNT.deferred.2024"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 15,109 in its own words. FY2025 revenue works out to about $450,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["FTNT.q.employees","FTNT.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2025 the balance sheet carried $2.5 billion in cash and cash equivalents, and $996 million of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtNoncurrent + LongTermDebtCurrent). Cash exceeded that debt by $1.5 billion (computed from three filed figures).","cites":["FTNT.cash.2025","FTNT.debtLong.2025","FTNT.debtCurrent.2025"]}]},"fin":{"FTNT":{"insiders":{"from":"2025-11-23","to":"2026-11-23","complete":true,"listed":72,"read":72,"other":0,"failed":0,"odd":0,"people":[["Ohlgart Christiane","Chief Financial Officer"],["Xie Michael","VP, Engineering & CTO, director"],["Xie Ken","President & CEO, director"],["Whittle John","